            "text": "theorem bandGeometry_argumentCost_le (B : Plane ≃L[ℝ] Plane) {h : ℝ} (hh : 0 ≤ h)\n    {n gap D : ℕ} (hn : 4 ≤ n) (hd : gap ≤ D) (center : Plane) :\n    argumentCost (bandGeometry B h n gap center) ≤ bandArgumentCost B D * ChartScales.S n"
